   "name": "Balanced Diet",
   "definition": "Describe what is meant by a balanced diet\nState the principal dietary sources and describe the importance of:\n(a) carbohydrates\n(b) fats and oils\n(c) proteins\n(d) vitamins, limited to C and D\n(e) mineral ions, limited to calcium and iron\n(f) fibre (roughage)\n(g) water",
   "video_id": "886092265"
