   "level": 2,
   "text": "Balanced Diet"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- A balanced diet consists of all of the food groups in the correct proportions\n- The necessary food groups are:\n\n  - **Carbohydrates**\n  - **Proteins**\n  - **Lipids**\n  - **Vitamins**\n  - **Minerals**\n  - **Dietary Fibre**\n  - **Water**"
